# 统一镜像构建上下文：只送四个服务目录 + container/，仓库其余内容（数据/缓存/密钥）不进镜像
*
!musicdl-service/
!musicbox-service/
!lxmusic-service/
!webui-service/
!container/
# 服务复用的公共 proxy 模块逐文件放行（目录先放行再收窄，父目录被排除时无法重新包含）
!proxy/
proxy/*
!proxy/__init__.py
!proxy/env_merge.py
!proxy/fnlog.py
!proxy/publicplaylists.py
!proxy/version.py
!proxy/llm_usage.py
!proxy/direct_play.py
!proxy/media_url.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/test_*.py
**/*.md
